config VIDEO_MTK_SENINF
	tristate "MediaTek CSI-2 receiver (SENINF)"
	depends on VIDEO_DEV && OF
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on VIDEO_MTK_CAM
	help
	  The SENINF is the CSI-2 receiver of MediaTek SoCs: it takes the D-PHY or
	  C-PHY lanes of a camera sensor and feeds the camera muxes that the capture
	  engines read from. This driver brings the receiver up and exposes its
	  packet and error counters, which is what a board needs while the sensor
	  side is being brought up.

	  Say M or Y here to have the receiver probed on the SoCs whose device tree
	  describes it.
